WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.140 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 2=

01:38.459 --> 01:40.459
I heard your wife's elder brother

01:40.739 --> 01:42.099
holds office in Tong County.

01:42.700 --> 01:43.500
Would you

01:43.500 --> 01:45.099
write me a letter

01:45.099 --> 01:45.980
of recommendation

01:46.580 --> 01:47.420
and have him vouch for me?

01:49.940 --> 01:50.340
(My)

01:50.819 --> 01:51.620
(brother-in-law?)

01:54.620 --> 01:55.620
Would it be out of line?

02:08.340 --> 02:09.259
This young lady

02:09.460 --> 02:10.220
is of the Fu family.

02:10.659 --> 02:12.259
Sir, would you read
her Eight Characters?

02:12.419 --> 02:14.659
Will she bring me good fortune

02:14.659 --> 02:15.500
and bless me with sons?

02:17.579 --> 02:18.940
Can she lend me support

02:18.940 --> 02:19.699
for my imperial exams?

02:20.139 --> 02:21.859
Without her exact hour of birth,

02:22.060 --> 02:23.340
I cannot read
your marriage compatibility.

02:24.259 --> 02:26.419
I suspect you have not obtained
her family's consent

02:26.659 --> 02:28.139
(Zuo Junjie &amp; Fu Tingyun)
and sought this divination in secret.

02:28.140 --> 02:29.856
(Zuo Junjie,
Madam Zuo's younger brother)

02:31.220 --> 02:32.340
(Scoundrel.)

02:35.099 --> 02:36.020
They speak of

02:37.139 --> 02:38.900
the Ninth Young Lady, do they not?

02:40.539 --> 02:41.940
Mr. Zhao, please do not misunderstand.

02:42.139 --> 02:43.500
This man is nothing but a rogue.

02:44.139 --> 02:44.859
Tingyun

02:45.220 --> 02:46.780
has never been betrothed to anyone.

02:46.780 --> 02:48.460
Don't get so worked up.

02:50.940 --> 02:51.460
Listen.

02:51.940 --> 02:53.060
She was born

02:53.180 --> 02:55.379
around the 18th day of the 4th month,
Fifth Year of Dacheng.

02:55.979 --> 02:56.740
On that day,

02:56.740 --> 02:58.500
all the magnolias in our home bloomed.

03:00.139 --> 03:00.819
Sir,

03:00.940 --> 03:01.740
please check it for me.

03:01.859 --> 03:02.900
This...

03:03.419 --> 03:03.940
Forget it.

03:04.139 --> 03:05.419
Sir, examine mine first instead.

03:06.099 --> 03:07.940
You have a fine nose.

03:08.180 --> 03:08.940
In years to come,

03:08.940 --> 03:10.900
you are destined
for a high official post.

03:11.780 --> 03:12.379
Sir,

03:12.699 --> 03:13.900
I've known since childhood

03:13.900 --> 03:15.180
that I am bound for high office.

03:15.539 --> 03:16.099
Someday,

03:16.259 --> 03:17.419
once I attain high office,

03:17.539 --> 03:18.979
I shall give you a shop.

03:19.379 --> 03:20.259
Splendid.

03:20.780 --> 03:21.460
Farewell.

03:51.539 --> 03:52.419
Who are you?

03:52.419 --> 03:52.900
How dare you

03:52.979 --> 03:53.740
strike me!

03:53.979 --> 03:55.220
I am Zuo, a scholar!

03:55.220 --> 03:55.579
Take this!

03:55.579 --> 03:56.900
I am Zuo, a scholar!

03:57.379 --> 03:58.379
My elder sister

03:58.659 --> 04:01.060
is the daughter-in-law
of the Magistrate's elder brother!

04:01.500 --> 04:02.300
Stop hitting me!

04:18.899 --> 04:19.660
He's still alive.

04:25.620 --> 04:26.219
Come.

04:26.459 --> 04:27.620
Many thanks, Mr. Zhao,

04:28.060 --> 04:29.540
for helping me settle the score.

04:30.180 --> 04:31.420
Indeed.

04:31.740 --> 04:32.139
Here.

04:34.139 --> 04:35.139
No need for small cups.

04:35.819 --> 04:36.940
I'll drain an entire pot.

04:41.660 --> 04:42.459
Tingzhuo,

04:44.060 --> 04:45.219
earlier you said something

04:46.139 --> 04:47.219
about Tong County,

04:48.459 --> 04:49.860
and my elder brother-in-law?

04:52.100 --> 04:53.819
What brother-in-law?

04:54.139 --> 04:55.819
I don't recall.

05:01.060 --> 05:01.779
Wait a moment.

05:05.379 --> 05:06.740
You...

05:11.259 --> 05:11.980
From now on,

05:13.579 --> 05:15.339
I'll be your elder brother-in-law.

05:18.620 --> 05:19.860
Look at the Fu family,

05:19.980 --> 05:21.620
a house full of hollow lotus roots.

05:23.019 --> 05:25.100
How could they produce
such a genuine soul?

05:31.019 --> 05:31.899
If you ask me,

05:32.219 --> 05:33.940
let's settle this marriage, then.

05:34.699 --> 05:36.459
The dowry we swindle over

05:37.259 --> 05:38.139
can serve as salt trade capital,

05:38.300 --> 05:39.540
and we'll gain a sister-in-law to boot.

05:41.819 --> 05:42.940
Mark my words.

05:43.620 --> 05:45.219
We agreed we're only after money.

05:45.980 --> 05:47.259
Don't even think
about tricking her into marriage.

05:49.060 --> 05:50.300
Look at us right now,

05:52.060 --> 05:53.139
living hand to mouth.

05:55.779 --> 05:56.699
We have no right to ruin

05:56.699 --> 05:58.060
an innocent young lady.

05:58.940 --> 05:59.860
Look at yourself.

06:00.259 --> 06:01.339
You are no longer young,

06:01.740 --> 06:02.620
yet still unwed.

06:03.100 --> 06:04.699
I just fear...

06:07.779 --> 06:09.459
I fear if I meet someone

06:14.019 --> 06:15.259
from a household like the Fu family,

06:15.699 --> 06:17.899
where everyone plots
and schemes all day long,

06:18.139 --> 06:19.660
weighing pros and cons in every matter,

06:19.660 --> 06:20.779
haggling over gains and losses,

06:21.139 --> 06:22.620
calculating how much dowry she'll bring,

06:22.620 --> 06:24.139
and how much betrothal gifts
I must offer.

06:25.860 --> 06:26.540
Tell me,

06:29.139 --> 06:30.219
is this a marriage,

06:34.339 --> 06:35.620
or merely a transaction?

07:02.940 --> 07:03.860
Is this

07:04.100 --> 07:05.219
Ground Snow?

07:07.819 --> 07:08.699
Look into it.

07:14.420 --> 07:15.500
Tingyun, there you are.

07:25.940 --> 07:27.060
What a righteous man.

07:27.980 --> 07:28.860
Last night,

07:29.019 --> 07:30.019
Mr. Zhao and I

07:30.100 --> 07:32.060
thrashed that scoundrel Zuo Junjie good.

07:32.259 --> 07:33.259
That Mr. Zhao

07:33.500 --> 07:34.660
has a chivalrous heart.

07:35.219 --> 07:37.060
He even stood up for you.

07:37.740 --> 07:38.540
Grandmother,

07:38.620 --> 07:40.379
Uncle and Aunt have been misled

07:40.540 --> 07:42.180
for the sake of their own gain.

07:42.819 --> 07:45.259
But what made you fall
for Zhao Ling's tricks?

07:45.379 --> 07:47.180
Just because you two fought
side by side once,

07:47.180 --> 07:48.100
you become friends?

07:48.779 --> 07:51.139
Of course I only want you
to have a good match.

07:51.459 --> 07:52.459
Mr. Zhao

07:52.459 --> 07:53.180
is handsome and virtuous,

07:53.180 --> 07:53.940
and has a noble birth.

07:54.540 --> 07:56.300
If trouble ever comes your way
in the future,

07:56.500 --> 07:57.740
he will surely keep you safe.

07:58.300 --> 07:59.139
He's truly

07:59.139 --> 08:00.540
an ideal husband.

08:01.540 --> 08:03.139
What a pity you are not a woman.

08:03.860 --> 08:04.980
If you were, you could marry him,

08:05.180 --> 08:06.579
and it would be ideal for both sides.

08:11.899 --> 08:14.500
Why did you bring
a magnolia sapling, Ninth Young Lady?

08:15.219 --> 08:16.100
I have taken

08:16.100 --> 08:17.540
a fancy to you at first sight, Madam.

08:18.139 --> 08:20.139
There are many tangled outside affairs

08:20.259 --> 08:21.379
I cannot make sense of.

08:21.899 --> 08:24.100
I truly have no one
to turn to for advice.

08:26.980 --> 08:28.180
What would you like to ask?

08:28.540 --> 08:29.699
I would like to ask

08:30.500 --> 08:31.660
about Mr. Zhao.

08:33.739 --> 08:35.020
You're quite sharp-witted

08:35.780 --> 08:37.180
to have come to me.

08:37.900 --> 08:38.380
Have a seat.

08:42.420 --> 08:43.300
Salt administration

08:44.020 --> 08:45.459
bears heavily on people's livelihood,

08:45.940 --> 08:47.260
and even more on military
and state governance.

08:47.859 --> 08:49.380
Officials dispatched to oversee the work

08:49.459 --> 08:50.979
are mostly high-ranking and powerful.

08:51.780 --> 08:52.859
If a salt shortage

08:52.859 --> 08:54.260
escalates into a grain famine,

08:55.219 --> 08:57.300
could a mere local Imperial Salt Censor

08:58.619 --> 09:00.260
shoulder such grave responsibility?

09:01.619 --> 09:03.380
(He truly is a fraud.)

09:05.739 --> 09:06.579
Madam,

09:06.579 --> 09:07.459
didn't you say

09:07.459 --> 09:09.219
you'd stay out of
the Fu family's affairs?

09:10.819 --> 09:12.260
The magnolia itself is splendid,

09:14.420 --> 09:15.780
yet its original pot

09:16.940 --> 09:18.219
is a burden.

09:19.859 --> 09:21.540
I acted on impulse back then

09:21.540 --> 09:23.020
and put her in a tough spot.

09:23.099 --> 09:24.699
So I offered her some guidance.

09:26.060 --> 09:27.819
How much she can take to heart

09:29.060 --> 09:30.579
depends on her own fate.

09:31.300 --> 09:33.499
It is also a test for her.

09:35.660 --> 09:36.260
My Lady,

09:36.339 --> 09:37.459
I've checked at the salt shop.

09:37.619 --> 09:38.739
It's the finest top-grade salt,

09:38.739 --> 09:39.339
Ground Snow.

09:44.420 --> 09:46.219
All Ground Snow from Huaying

09:47.020 --> 09:48.780
was confiscated by Eldest Uncle.

09:49.499 --> 09:50.739
How could he still have any?

09:53.780 --> 09:55.180
Aside from the Imperial Envoy,

09:56.219 --> 09:58.099
no one else can get Ground Snow.

09:59.300 --> 10:00.660
He is Jiuweijiao.

10:05.180 --> 10:06.260
The eyebrow-height staff won't suit me.

10:06.420 --> 10:07.140
I'd rather wield a blade.

10:07.660 --> 10:08.819
You want to wield a blade again?

10:09.339 --> 10:10.739
How many times have I told you?

10:11.099 --> 10:12.260
When roaming the jianghu,

10:12.699 --> 10:14.579
a few self-defense skills
are all you need.

10:16.859 --> 10:18.660
Your hands have never been stained
with blood.

10:19.300 --> 10:20.540
If you ever get the chance,

10:21.180 --> 10:22.819
you can still choose the right path.

10:25.739 --> 10:26.859
I heard

10:26.859 --> 10:28.180
Feng Laosi, the salt merchant,

10:28.180 --> 10:29.420
has bad blood with Jiuweijiao.

10:29.859 --> 10:31.420
Why don't we turn the situation
to our advantage?

10:32.140 --> 10:33.020
We'll claim

10:33.099 --> 10:34.699
Jiuweijiao disguised himself
as the Imperial Envoy

10:34.699 --> 10:35.579
and infiltrated the Fu family.

10:35.780 --> 10:37.619
We'll let someone else deal
with the fraud for us.

10:39.499 --> 10:40.459
Mr. Zhao.

10:40.540 --> 10:42.180
Miss Fu requests your presence.

10:42.339 --> 10:43.380
She has something important to discuss.

10:45.300 --> 10:46.260
What matter?

10:46.619 --> 10:48.660
It's regarding arranging funds for you.

10:52.020 --> 10:52.859
Miss Fu

10:52.859 --> 10:54.739
also wants to contribute
to the fund raising.

10:54.739 --> 10:56.380
She hopes to ask you a few questions.

10:57.940 --> 10:58.859
Please go ahead.

10:59.459 --> 11:01.060
Mr. Zhao, have you ever seen

11:01.219 --> 11:02.380
ten thousand taels of silver?

11:04.739 --> 11:05.979
How many chests would it fill?

11:12.979 --> 11:14.260
If two men carry one,

11:14.540 --> 11:15.420
can they manage it?

11:24.140 --> 11:25.020
It's those two men.

11:26.540 --> 11:28.619
Who might these guests be?

11:30.219 --> 11:32.699
You are the Jiuweijiao spoken of
across the jianghu.

11:33.499 --> 11:35.979
So you're nothing but a weak scholar.

11:37.540 --> 11:38.219
Take them down!

11:40.020 --> 11:40.579
Mr. Zhao,

11:40.940 --> 11:42.300
we're badly outnumbered.

11:43.219 --> 11:44.619
That's the jianghu way.
Run when you must.

11:45.579 --> 11:47.219
Only those who know when to run
can survive the jianghu.

11:48.699 --> 11:49.219
Understood.

12:09.859 --> 12:11.339
Interesting.

12:11.979 --> 12:12.660
After them!

12:12.660 --> 12:13.540
Don't let him escape!

12:14.060 --> 12:14.619
Halt!

12:14.619 --> 12:15.219
Seize them!

12:24.020 --> 12:24.979
I closed the window.

12:24.979 --> 12:25.940
How did it open again?

12:33.060 --> 12:34.180
What's this?

12:36.819 --> 12:37.780
My Lady.

12:39.300 --> 12:40.339
Ground Snow.

12:43.420 --> 12:44.579
What do we do, My Lady?

12:45.380 --> 12:47.140
He'll come to seek revenge on us.

12:52.979 --> 12:54.579
(Ninth Young Lady, you seek
a prestigious high-status marriage.)

12:54.699 --> 12:56.339
(Yet your family lacks
the virtue worthy of such standing.)

12:56.339 --> 12:58.699
(Beware the fall
from lofty hopes and empty dreams.)

12:59.099 --> 12:59.940
Scoundrel.

13:00.499 --> 13:01.420
My Lady,

13:01.900 --> 13:03.300
what could he mean by this?

13:03.819 --> 13:05.099
(Fu Residence)
Will he seek revenge on us?

13:05.180 --> 13:06.300
Whatever his intentions may be,

13:06.859 --> 13:07.739
we only need

13:08.380 --> 13:09.859
to capture him as soon as possible.

13:10.300 --> 13:10.859
What

13:10.859 --> 13:11.940
about the salt?

13:17.180 --> 13:18.499
Report this to the authorities.

13:19.380 --> 13:20.739
Offer a hefty reward for his capture.

13:20.979 --> 13:23.380
Claim he attempted to swindle
ten thousand taels of silver.

13:23.380 --> 13:23.780
Understood.

13:23.979 --> 13:24.579
Wait.

13:25.819 --> 13:26.940
Change "attempted to swindle"

13:27.499 --> 13:28.660
to "swindled".

13:31.420 --> 13:33.339
(Wanted Notice)
Zhao Ling and his accomplice

13:33.339 --> 13:34.900
infiltrated the Fu Residence in Huaying

13:35.180 --> 13:37.020
and fraudulently obtained

13:37.020 --> 13:37.859
ten thousand taels of silver.

13:38.579 --> 13:40.380
Anyone who reports their whereabouts

13:40.380 --> 13:41.859
shall receive a reward
of one hundred taels from the Fu family.

13:42.020 --> 13:42.979
Whoever captures them

13:42.979 --> 13:43.979
will be awarded one thousand taels.

13:44.420 --> 13:46.099
(Swindled?)

13:46.180 --> 13:47.219
A thousand taels?

13:47.219 --> 13:47.979
That's a fortune!

13:49.339 --> 13:50.260
Make way!

13:50.819 --> 13:52.140
Who is Zhao Ling?

13:52.140 --> 13:53.060
How dare he cheat the Fu family.

13:53.060 --> 13:54.020
Never seen him before.

14:00.260 --> 14:00.979
My Lady,

14:01.300 --> 14:03.060
why did you change
"attempted to swindle"

14:03.060 --> 14:04.339
to "swindled"?

14:06.300 --> 14:07.579
All under heaven hustle,

14:07.579 --> 14:08.660
drawn by gain.

14:09.020 --> 14:10.260
All under heaven bustle,

14:10.420 --> 14:11.499
chasing profit.

14:12.020 --> 14:12.979
Grandmother once said,

14:13.300 --> 14:14.579
those wanderers of the jianghu

14:14.739 --> 14:16.459
claim loyalty
and righteousness come first.

14:16.579 --> 14:17.099
Mr. Zhao.

14:17.099 --> 14:18.579
Yet in the end they still

14:19.099 --> 14:20.660
cannot escape the lure of profit.

14:20.819 --> 14:21.540
This is

14:22.660 --> 14:24.180
human nature.

14:24.420 --> 14:25.739
We're all like brothers here.

14:26.060 --> 14:26.660
Come and eat.

14:27.380 --> 14:28.140
It's not much.

14:28.140 --> 14:28.940
Mr. Zhao, you go first.

14:29.300 --> 14:30.060
Bao,

14:30.219 --> 14:31.900
when have you ever seen
Mr. Zhao keep all the food to himself?

14:32.499 --> 14:33.099
Here.

14:33.660 --> 14:34.499
Let's eat together.

14:57.699 --> 14:59.339
You two haven't been with me long,

15:00.380 --> 15:01.780
so you don't know one of my rules.

15:03.459 --> 15:04.979
Whoever prepares the meal

15:07.300 --> 15:08.260
takes the first bite.

15:08.940 --> 15:10.459
Only then can I eat in peace.

15:14.260 --> 15:14.979
Go on, eat.

15:27.900 --> 15:29.140
You poisoned the food!

15:33.579 --> 15:34.699
Trying to run?

15:36.699 --> 15:37.300
Mr. Zhao.

15:37.420 --> 15:38.300
He must be punished.

15:39.900 --> 15:40.619
Mr. Zhao!

15:40.979 --> 15:42.420
Spare my life, Mr. Zhao!

15:42.819 --> 15:43.739
Mr. Zhao!

15:44.739 --> 15:45.540
Mr. Zhao!

15:49.819 --> 15:50.660
Mr. Zhao!

15:57.300 --> 15:58.219
Do you know why

15:58.219 --> 15:59.219
I love red-stalk greens?

15:59.380 --> 16:01.140
Wild greens like these
grew everywhere in the old days.

16:02.099 --> 16:03.540
They were all we had
to fill our bellies.

16:04.020 --> 16:05.900
But you've only been
with me a short while,

16:06.660 --> 16:08.739
so there's no way you'd know
my fondness for this dish.

16:09.660 --> 16:10.979
But why

16:16.780 --> 16:18.979
did you choose to poison
this soup of all things?

16:20.380 --> 16:21.459
Yuanbao,

16:22.459 --> 16:23.780
there is a kind of person in this world

16:25.339 --> 16:26.579
who can only share hardship,

16:27.979 --> 16:29.099
not prosperity.

16:33.099 --> 16:33.819
Prosperity?

16:36.819 --> 16:38.619
All these years by your side,

16:39.060 --> 16:40.540
I've lived in constant fear.

16:41.579 --> 16:42.420
Where's the prosperity?

16:43.380 --> 16:45.300
You believed that lie
about the swindled silver?

16:46.859 --> 16:47.459
I did.

16:57.380 --> 16:58.459
I will make up

16:59.940 --> 17:01.140
that five thousand taels to you.

17:02.859 --> 17:03.579
Leave now.

17:09.180 --> 17:10.539
I've stuck with you all these years

17:11.940 --> 17:12.860
only for money.

17:15.380 --> 17:16.219
It's a deal.

17:26.699 --> 17:27.979
You, Chuan, and Biao

17:30.380 --> 17:31.620
head back to Yongning Prefecture first.

17:32.739 --> 17:33.459
Mr. Zhao,

17:33.979 --> 17:35.299
are you staying here alone?

17:35.940 --> 17:37.140
At first, I thought

17:37.580 --> 17:38.940
if we lost that money,

17:39.660 --> 17:40.820
then so be it.

17:43.779 --> 17:45.420
But after what happened today,

17:46.340 --> 17:47.820
I can't just let this go.

17:49.620 --> 17:51.180
Now that the label of "swindled"

17:51.180 --> 17:52.779
has been placed upon my shoulders,

17:54.299 --> 17:55.539
I won't bear it for nothing.

17:57.940 --> 17:59.019
No matter what it takes,

18:00.420 --> 18:02.739
I will get the money back.

18:07.499 --> 18:09.660
(I live in a humble cottage
of brick and clay,)

18:10.180 --> 18:12.539
(while that young lady dwells
in rich, ornate towers.)

18:13.340 --> 18:15.259
(I dress plainly in black robes
and white socks,)

18:15.340 --> 18:17.420
(yet she adorns herself
in vibrant reds and greens.)

18:17.940 --> 18:19.580
(I stay alone in an empty chamber,)

18:19.660 --> 18:21.940
(but she may seek a fine match,)

18:21.940 --> 18:22.820
(and from now on,)

18:23.100 --> 18:25.100
(will have company every single night.)

18:25.900 --> 18:27.900
(Aren't we all flesh and blood,)

18:27.900 --> 18:30.019
(walking within these courtyard walls?)

18:31.940 --> 18:33.459
(They treat me this way)

18:33.539 --> 18:35.459
(only because I am lowly.)

18:36.180 --> 18:37.860
(But what if)

18:38.620 --> 18:41.539
(I hold their vital weaknesses
in my grasp?)

18:42.979 --> 18:44.059
You wretch!

18:44.059 --> 18:45.180
Have you lost your mind?

18:45.180 --> 18:46.620
You're a widow!

18:59.340 --> 18:59.940
You...

19:00.180 --> 19:01.660
What do you want?

19:09.140 --> 19:10.620
I want Tingyun.

19:12.979 --> 19:13.940
Grandmother,

19:14.299 --> 19:16.580
Tingyun is old enough to marry now.

19:16.940 --> 19:18.219
My younger brother Junjie

19:18.340 --> 19:20.499
grew up right before our eyes.

19:20.499 --> 19:21.459
We know him through and through.

19:21.459 --> 19:22.940
He is diligent and eager to learn.

19:22.940 --> 19:24.779
I beg you to grant them

19:24.779 --> 19:26.100
your blessing for their marriage.

19:26.340 --> 19:27.100
My sister-in-law,

19:28.979 --> 19:30.180
what

19:30.539 --> 19:32.219
is all this fuss about?

19:32.539 --> 19:33.420
Tingyun

19:33.660 --> 19:35.620
is your niece after all.

19:35.900 --> 19:37.140
How could you bear to do this?

19:37.779 --> 19:38.539
Well,

19:39.380 --> 19:41.059
I speak

19:41.059 --> 19:42.259
only for Tingyun's good.

19:42.739 --> 19:44.420
Two match proposals have fallen through.

19:44.860 --> 19:46.180
First you sought a second-rank official,

19:46.620 --> 19:48.420
yet the Yu family turned you down.

19:48.660 --> 19:49.860
Then you found a censor,

19:49.860 --> 19:51.380
only to discover he was an impostor.

19:51.380 --> 19:51.660
You...

19:52.219 --> 19:53.420
Would you really let the girl

19:53.420 --> 19:54.779
waste away her youth like this?

19:54.860 --> 19:55.259
You...

19:57.380 --> 19:58.140
Mother,

19:58.660 --> 19:59.860
anyhow,

19:59.860 --> 20:02.340
I will never consent to this marriage.

20:02.860 --> 20:03.660
Alright,

20:04.420 --> 20:06.140
since you refuse,

20:06.420 --> 20:08.660
we may as well ask Tingyun's will.

20:09.459 --> 20:11.180
She's grown up now.

20:11.539 --> 20:12.660
For all matters,

20:12.739 --> 20:14.180
she can make her own choices,

20:15.059 --> 20:16.940
lest she scheme behind our backs,

20:16.940 --> 20:18.420
and act first and report later.

20:18.900 --> 20:21.100
Take exposing
Zhao Ling's fraud for example.

20:21.499 --> 20:22.900
If she disliked the match,

20:22.900 --> 20:24.660
she could have spoken to her elders.

20:24.660 --> 20:26.739
Instead, she brought outsiders
to stir trouble at home,

20:26.820 --> 20:28.580
making us a laughingstock.

20:28.699 --> 20:29.539
Who, in this household,

20:29.539 --> 20:30.620
holds the authority?

20:35.499 --> 20:36.539
Still, that incident

20:37.180 --> 20:38.219
is Zhao Ling's fault,

20:38.820 --> 20:40.140
not Tingyun's.

20:41.779 --> 20:42.940
Grandmother!

20:43.979 --> 20:45.019
Grandmother.

20:46.380 --> 20:48.499
Life as a widow is unbearable.

20:48.660 --> 20:51.140
I can barely hold on any longer.

20:51.420 --> 20:53.580
I need something to hope for.

20:54.100 --> 20:56.219
If Tingyun marries into the Zuo family,

20:56.420 --> 20:57.739
no matter how many more years I endure,

20:58.180 --> 20:58.900
I swear

20:59.059 --> 21:01.660
I will bring honor to the Fu family
by remaining chaste.

21:03.900 --> 21:05.019
What are you saying?

21:05.340 --> 21:06.699
People are living beings,

21:07.180 --> 21:08.499
yet memorial arches are lifeless stone.

21:09.259 --> 21:11.019
Is my own daughter

21:11.739 --> 21:13.620
worth less than a mere arch?

21:14.380 --> 21:15.180
Sister-in-law,

21:15.660 --> 21:16.380
our family's honor

21:16.380 --> 21:18.340
rests on these chastity arches.

21:19.180 --> 21:20.860
Look at Zuo.

21:21.299 --> 21:23.100
If she causes any trouble,

21:23.779 --> 21:25.620
it will ruin
not one chastity memorial arch,

21:25.620 --> 21:26.900
but four!

21:35.620 --> 21:36.860
Madam Yu has arrived.

21:44.779 --> 21:45.699
Madam Yu.

21:47.739 --> 21:48.820
What's going on here?

21:49.380 --> 21:50.860
Have I come at a bad time?

21:51.299 --> 21:53.100
Madam, you've come
at just the right moment.

21:53.259 --> 21:54.380
Please take a seat.

22:07.539 --> 22:08.580
This poor girl

22:09.100 --> 22:10.259
dreamed last night

22:10.259 --> 22:12.499
of her beloved late husband.

22:12.860 --> 22:13.979
She cried bitterly.

22:14.180 --> 22:16.219
She was just pouring out
her heart to me.

22:16.979 --> 22:18.259
Poor girl.

22:18.259 --> 22:19.100
Stand up.

22:24.979 --> 22:26.100
Grandmother is right.

22:26.499 --> 22:27.539
My late husband appeared
to me in a dream.

22:27.739 --> 22:29.420
He doted on Tingyun from childhood.

22:29.420 --> 22:30.499
He cannot bear the thought
of her marrying far away.

22:30.860 --> 22:33.380
He bade me do all I can
to keep her close by.

22:33.940 --> 22:35.259
I beg you to grant
your blessing, Grandmother.

22:35.779 --> 22:36.580
Tingyun

22:37.380 --> 22:38.820
is the Zuo family's only choice.

22:39.739 --> 22:40.699
We'll talk

22:41.340 --> 22:42.620
of this later.

22:43.059 --> 22:44.180
You may withdraw first.

22:44.699 --> 22:45.779
Look how tearful you are.

22:45.779 --> 22:46.940
How can you receive guests?

22:50.100 --> 22:51.180
No need to trouble yourselves.

22:51.979 --> 22:53.820
It seems I truly came
at an awkward hour.

22:54.219 --> 22:55.459
I shall speak my piece
and take my leave.

22:56.059 --> 22:56.900
Earlier,

22:56.979 --> 22:58.259
I had servants move the bed

22:58.259 --> 22:59.420
to the west wing.

22:59.860 --> 23:01.739
Yet Jingxiu could not rest easy there.

23:01.940 --> 23:03.019
So I thought to myself,

23:03.259 --> 23:04.459
"I ought to shift the bed

23:04.699 --> 23:06.219
back to the east wing instead."

23:09.900 --> 23:10.779
Old Madam Fu,

23:10.979 --> 23:11.940
Fifth Madam Fu,

23:12.420 --> 23:13.620
do you understand

23:13.940 --> 23:15.019
what lies in my heart?

23:18.019 --> 23:18.820
Madam Yu.

23:19.100 --> 23:20.420
Your family is a noble house.

23:20.420 --> 23:22.340
You could find
any daughter-in-law you wish.

23:22.340 --> 23:23.499
Tingyun has a headstrong temper,

23:23.499 --> 23:24.340
and shows no respect to her elders.

23:24.340 --> 23:25.940
Only my younger brother
would take her without disdain.

23:26.900 --> 23:28.259
Are you out of your mind?

23:35.539 --> 23:37.219
A fine young lady attracts suitors
from a hundred homes.

23:39.420 --> 23:41.299
Ninth Young Lady is blessed
with both virtue and wisdom,

23:41.499 --> 23:42.699
fit to bring peace and prosperity
to any household.

23:42.979 --> 23:45.059
I hold genuine affection for her.

23:48.860 --> 23:49.779
Old Madam Fu,

23:49.779 --> 23:50.580
Fifth Madam Fu,

23:51.100 --> 23:52.539
if you see fit to consent,

23:52.539 --> 23:54.140
send word to me
at your earliest convenience.

23:54.140 --> 23:55.860
I will send a letter
to the capital straight away

23:55.940 --> 23:57.539
to settle this marriage proposal.

23:58.539 --> 23:59.459
Very well.

24:00.019 --> 24:00.660
Farewell.

24:03.100 --> 24:03.979
Madam Yu.

24:04.259 --> 24:05.019
Madam Yu.

24:05.019 --> 24:05.459
Madam...

24:08.940 --> 24:09.620
Mother,

24:09.979 --> 24:10.860
please help me.

24:11.219 --> 24:12.019
Mother.

24:12.620 --> 24:14.059
- Mother, please help me.
- Someone.

24:14.499 --> 24:16.340
Drag this vile woman
to the ancestral hall,

24:16.860 --> 24:18.739
and leave her there to fend for herself.

24:19.019 --> 24:19.699
Mother!

24:20.699 --> 24:21.620
Mother!

24:21.620 --> 24:22.860
Mother, please help me.

24:22.860 --> 24:23.299
Move!

24:23.499 --> 24:24.420
Mother!

24:28.340 --> 24:30.219
I renounce

24:30.820 --> 24:32.259
the fourth memorial arch.

24:33.900 --> 24:36.539
(This betrothal to the Yu family)

24:37.059 --> 24:38.459
(shall secure)

24:38.459 --> 24:40.019
(our family's future.)

24:43.059 --> 24:43.860
Hurry up.

24:43.860 --> 24:44.340
Move.

24:44.459 --> 24:45.699
Seal everything off completely.

24:47.140 --> 24:48.100
My Lady,

24:48.180 --> 24:49.340
it's pouring rain.

24:49.340 --> 24:50.779
What brings you to such a place?

24:50.940 --> 24:52.979
You ought to head back, My Lady.

24:54.299 --> 24:56.739
This foul, unholy place
is no fit spot for you.

24:56.820 --> 24:58.059
Please return at once.

25:01.420 --> 25:01.820
Well...

25:10.499 --> 25:13.259
When I first married
into this household,

25:14.580 --> 25:16.739
I only cared for the eighty taels
of betrothal silver

25:17.380 --> 25:19.340
and three taels of monthly stipend.

25:20.219 --> 25:22.019
I truly thought

25:22.380 --> 25:24.499
being a widow was well worth it.

25:25.340 --> 25:26.900
Yet by the third year,

25:27.979 --> 25:29.140
I could bear it no longer.

25:29.739 --> 25:30.860
I begged to dissolve the marriage,

25:30.860 --> 25:31.900
to return to my home.

25:32.739 --> 25:34.259
(Fu Family Academy)
Grandmother then sent servants

25:35.180 --> 25:37.140
to fetch my younger brother
to keep me company.

25:38.059 --> 25:39.620
She enrolled him in the clan school,

25:39.820 --> 25:41.739
promising him a bright future.

25:42.900 --> 25:44.580
So I thought it was a fair trade.

25:45.779 --> 25:47.459
But my brother

25:48.660 --> 25:50.580
was never cut out for studying.

25:51.180 --> 25:52.580
By the fifth year,

25:53.420 --> 25:55.219
it was clear he would never pass
the imperial exams.

25:55.979 --> 25:57.459
Regret gnawed at me again.

26:01.380 --> 26:03.340
Then Grandmother made me another vow.

26:04.420 --> 26:06.459
Every year
at the Flower Goddess Festival,

26:07.380 --> 26:09.019
I would preside over the rituals.

26:09.820 --> 26:12.019
She said it would let me stand
in the limelight

26:12.779 --> 26:13.699
to ease my loneliness.

26:19.180 --> 26:20.299
How foolish I was.

26:22.660 --> 26:24.420
I actually believed her words.

26:24.940 --> 26:27.660
I actually thought
I had a place in this family.

26:29.019 --> 26:30.860
But in this family,

26:35.299 --> 26:38.059
not a single soul
truly holds me in regard.

26:40.019 --> 26:40.940
If they did,

26:46.739 --> 26:48.620
why would they begrudge my brother

26:48.620 --> 26:50.459
a Fu young lady?

26:54.299 --> 26:55.100
Zuo.

26:56.539 --> 26:59.059
You once held me on your lap
and played with me.

27:00.019 --> 27:02.019
But as your temper
grew bitter and twisted,

27:02.940 --> 27:04.259
you came to loathe me more and more.

27:05.059 --> 27:07.100
I am not the cause
of all your suffering.

27:07.940 --> 27:09.499
Why must you fixate your hatred on me?

27:11.820 --> 27:13.219
Through endless lonely nights,

27:13.739 --> 27:15.259
ten years of my youth,

27:16.459 --> 27:17.499
all I earned

27:18.299 --> 27:21.059
was nothing but praise
for the Fu family's pure moral code.

27:23.539 --> 27:25.140
So when your marriage
was being arranged,

27:27.180 --> 27:29.180
they added a generous entry

27:29.860 --> 27:31.420
to your dowry inventory.

27:49.900 --> 27:51.539
They used my betrothal

27:52.259 --> 27:54.180
to smooth the path for your match,

27:55.499 --> 27:57.219
then leveraged your marriage

28:00.739 --> 28:03.499
to further the Fu family's rise
in the bureaucracy.

28:04.380 --> 28:05.860
Do you truly believe Grandmother

28:07.380 --> 28:09.380
plans for you out of genuine care?

28:10.340 --> 28:11.979
She only coaxes you

28:13.180 --> 28:15.019
into blind obedience.

28:21.299 --> 28:22.420
Don't believe a word she says.

28:23.180 --> 28:24.820
Old Madam has always doted on you most.

28:26.100 --> 28:27.140
She speaks such words

28:28.340 --> 28:30.259
only to grieve your heart.

28:31.140 --> 28:33.100
It was so close,
just a hair's breadth away.

28:34.779 --> 28:36.940
That cursed Madam Yu.

28:38.660 --> 28:40.539
It was only barely out of my grasp.

28:44.620 --> 28:47.820
Yet that old hag seized
the opportunity in the end.

28:51.900 --> 28:53.739
We are cut from the same cloth.

28:54.059 --> 28:56.019
Why do you bloom like a magnolia
on the branch,

28:56.019 --> 28:58.259
while I am but mud beneath your feet?

29:02.420 --> 29:03.100
Hurry!

29:03.100 --> 29:03.820
Stop her!

29:03.940 --> 29:04.900
Hold her back!

29:05.699 --> 29:06.979
Have you lost your wits?

29:06.979 --> 29:08.059
Crazy woman!

29:08.219 --> 29:09.259
Let go of me!

29:09.699 --> 29:10.739
Let me go.

29:10.900 --> 29:11.779
Are you all right?

29:13.299 --> 29:15.219
What a loyal hound you are.

29:15.739 --> 29:16.860
So eager to defend your lady.

29:17.620 --> 29:19.380
Has she fulfilled your wish,

29:19.739 --> 29:21.699
matching you up with Fu Tingzhuo?

29:22.739 --> 29:25.180
How are you any different
from my brother?

29:25.499 --> 29:26.380
Do you truly think

29:26.380 --> 29:27.340
that meekly obeying every order,

29:27.340 --> 29:28.259
letting others manipulate you,

29:28.259 --> 29:29.699
will earn you a share of the spoils?

29:30.059 --> 29:31.180
Don't delude yourself.

29:31.380 --> 29:32.380
In the Fu family's eyes...

29:32.380 --> 29:33.019
Watch your tongue!

29:33.019 --> 29:35.180
You're merely another Zuo Junjie.

29:35.539 --> 29:36.779
Even your father,

29:36.779 --> 29:37.940
a renowned great scholar,

29:38.019 --> 29:39.380
has served the Fu family
for over a decade,

29:39.380 --> 29:41.219
yet he is no more than an extra entry

29:41.219 --> 29:42.219
added to her dowry inventory.

29:48.340 --> 29:49.180
Yake.

29:59.140 --> 30:00.019
Drag her away.

30:00.380 --> 30:01.140
My Lady,

30:01.140 --> 30:01.779
Miss Fan,

30:01.900 --> 30:03.580
please hurry back to your chambers.

30:03.860 --> 30:04.660
- Let go!
- Get up.

30:05.019 --> 30:05.979
Don't leave.

30:06.420 --> 30:07.499
Don't go.

30:07.860 --> 30:09.140
Drag her inside at once!

30:09.259 --> 30:09.900
Shut the door!

30:09.979 --> 30:11.219
Nail it firmly shut!

30:11.860 --> 30:12.739
Hurry, let's go.

30:23.259 --> 30:24.100
A big world

30:24.100 --> 30:25.499
brings all kinds of people.

30:25.779 --> 30:26.900
Madam Zuo should remember

30:26.900 --> 30:28.259
where her brother comes from.

30:28.459 --> 30:29.900
He only stands
thanks to the family's support.

30:29.900 --> 30:31.299
Yet he acts as if he belongs here,

30:31.380 --> 30:33.420
reaching far above his station
for the Ninth Young Lady.

30:40.299 --> 30:41.219
(Above his station?)

30:41.820 --> 30:43.539
(I brought two pots of narcissus today.)

30:44.219 --> 30:45.539
(When you see him,)

30:45.900 --> 30:47.140
(you could give him one.)

30:59.580 --> 31:00.380
Where is she?

31:03.660 --> 31:05.219
She was here just a moment ago.

31:17.940 --> 31:18.820
Tell me,

31:20.459 --> 31:22.620
was Moxiang just insulting Zuo Junjie,

31:24.140 --> 31:25.219
or was it me?

31:26.860 --> 31:28.499
The Ninth Young Lady went too far.

31:29.100 --> 31:31.059
You even took a hit
from that hairpin for her, Miss,

31:31.180 --> 31:32.499
yet she did nothing for you.

31:35.420 --> 31:36.940
She must think I am unworthy too.

31:39.219 --> 31:41.660
Everyone calls me another Zuo Junjie.

31:44.019 --> 31:45.580
Even she sees me the same way.

31:59.699 --> 32:01.100
Mr. Yu, you work far too hard.

32:01.420 --> 32:02.779
Madam will grow worried
if you stay any later.

32:03.820 --> 32:04.499
It is fine.

32:04.860 --> 32:06.539
I was fully engrossed in discussion
with Master Fan.

32:06.820 --> 32:07.860
Words flowed freely,

32:07.979 --> 32:08.860
and I had to speak my mind.

32:13.219 --> 32:14.499
Where did this potted flower come from?

32:17.660 --> 32:18.900
I reckon no one wants it.

32:20.940 --> 32:22.059
I find it quite elegant.

32:24.059 --> 32:25.900
Most plants grow in soil,

32:26.340 --> 32:27.580
yet this one thrives in water.

32:28.420 --> 32:29.900
It holds an air of pure, refined charm.

32:31.059 --> 32:31.979
Fetch a new vessel,

32:32.660 --> 32:33.660
and bring it back to tend to.

32:34.340 --> 32:34.779
Understood.

32:40.219 --> 32:40.699
Wait.

32:41.340 --> 32:42.219
What are you doing?

32:42.820 --> 32:43.779
Mr. Yu,

32:43.779 --> 32:45.380
Madam specially sent for servants
from the Fu family

32:45.380 --> 32:46.860
to move the bed back to the east.

32:52.940 --> 32:54.340
It was moved from east to west,

32:56.340 --> 32:57.860
then west back to east again.

32:58.380 --> 33:00.860
I cannot even decide where my own bed
shall be placed.

33:11.420 --> 33:12.140
Yake,

33:12.860 --> 33:13.900
are you all right?

33:16.699 --> 33:18.259
I never gave your daffodils

33:20.860 --> 33:22.620
to Tingzhuo.

33:23.620 --> 33:25.420
You know Grandmother's temper.

33:25.580 --> 33:27.219
She values family honor
and tradition above all else.

33:28.620 --> 33:30.180
I feared if I acted rashly,

33:30.180 --> 33:31.539
it would only backfire.

33:34.459 --> 33:35.860
You've misread me, Tingyun.

33:37.140 --> 33:38.699
That was never my intention.

33:39.660 --> 33:41.299
Your family
has shown me kindness for years.

33:43.380 --> 33:44.539
That pot of daffodils

33:45.059 --> 33:46.979
was merely a small token of thanks.

33:47.779 --> 33:49.660
I give such gifts to more
than just Seventh Young Master,

33:51.660 --> 33:53.420
let alone to express secret feelings
through flowers.

33:57.019 --> 33:57.699
(Fu Family Academy)
Master Fan,

33:58.259 --> 33:59.380
I have a question,

33:59.660 --> 34:00.860
but I cannot seem to find an answer.

34:01.459 --> 34:02.580
May I ask for your guidance?

34:03.499 --> 34:04.259
What is it?

34:04.620 --> 34:05.459
It is often said

34:06.059 --> 34:07.259
that filial piety stands foremost
among all virtues.

34:08.619 --> 34:09.499
As a son,

34:10.179 --> 34:12.380
one ought to heed
all his mother's instructions.

34:14.340 --> 34:15.139
Yet suppose

34:16.260 --> 34:17.300
there is a matter

34:18.459 --> 34:20.220
on which the son wishes to go
against his mother's will.

34:21.900 --> 34:23.179
Does that make him unfilial?

34:24.900 --> 34:25.780
(Fan Kun, a Renowned Scholar)
It depends

34:26.220 --> 34:27.420
on the matter in question.

34:27.979 --> 34:28.740
If trivial,

34:28.740 --> 34:29.539
it is not worth dwelling on.

34:29.979 --> 34:30.940
It is...

34:32.979 --> 34:34.059
the important matter of marriage.

34:37.179 --> 34:38.780
Suppose the bride Mother chooses

34:40.340 --> 34:41.820
is not to the son's liking, what then?

34:43.900 --> 34:44.659
Yake.

34:46.179 --> 34:47.220
Suppose in the future

34:47.539 --> 34:48.780
the husband I pick for you

34:48.780 --> 34:49.820
fails to win your heart,

34:50.420 --> 34:51.340
what would you do?

34:52.300 --> 34:53.900
Who have you chosen for me?

34:55.019 --> 34:56.579
I'm merely speaking hypothetically.

34:57.139 --> 34:58.860
A student came to consult me
on this question.

35:02.459 --> 35:03.459
The answer is plain to see.

35:03.900 --> 35:05.619
Empress Lv forced her son
Emperor Hui of Han

35:05.619 --> 35:07.340
to wed her niece Zhang Yan.

35:07.659 --> 35:09.900
Afterwards, the Emperor
doted solely on a palace maid

35:10.380 --> 35:11.499
and passed away young from melancholy.

35:12.499 --> 35:14.420
Emperor Hui bore no dislike
toward Zhang Yan herself.

35:14.900 --> 35:16.539
He merely resented his mother.

35:17.579 --> 35:18.659
No wonder.

35:19.539 --> 35:21.099
His question was never about marriage,

35:22.300 --> 35:23.539
but about filial piety.

35:27.659 --> 35:28.700
I wonder which young master

35:28.700 --> 35:29.940
would share

35:30.179 --> 35:32.420
such private matters with an outsider.

35:33.820 --> 35:34.860
Who else could it be?

35:36.179 --> 35:37.740
There is only one young man

35:38.820 --> 35:39.740
whose marriage is being discussed.

35:40.059 --> 35:41.539
Could it be Mr. Yu?

35:42.539 --> 35:44.260
Tingyun curries favor with Madam Yu,

35:45.499 --> 35:46.900
yet shuns Mr. Yu.

35:48.460 --> 35:49.840
(Fu Family Academy)

35:58.780 --> 35:59.380
Master Fan?

36:14.420 --> 36:16.139
I grew them without much thought.

36:17.059 --> 36:18.940
No need to examine them
so closely, Young Master.

36:21.860 --> 36:22.740
Forgive my rudeness, Miss.

36:22.860 --> 36:23.579
No matter.

36:27.300 --> 36:28.900
I came to bring Father his meal.

36:29.979 --> 36:30.900
I shall leave after setting it down.

36:41.380 --> 36:42.979
Are you fond of flowers, Young Master?

36:44.139 --> 36:45.099
Not exactly.

36:46.780 --> 36:47.860
It was merely a coincidence.

36:48.579 --> 36:50.019
I picked up a pot the other day.

36:51.619 --> 36:52.940
It's grown the very same way.

36:53.579 --> 36:55.659
Could this flower belong to Miss Fan?

36:56.539 --> 36:58.539
In the entire Huaying,

36:58.619 --> 36:59.820
only she grows flowers

36:59.940 --> 37:00.860
in water.

37:01.700 --> 37:03.300
If you take a fancy to it,

37:03.940 --> 37:04.979
you may take it.

37:05.820 --> 37:07.019
Tend to it well.

37:07.979 --> 37:08.619
Miss,

37:08.740 --> 37:10.780
Narcissus is your given name.

37:23.099 --> 37:24.139
Greetings, Madam Yu.

37:24.740 --> 37:25.900
At the Flower Goddess Festival,

37:26.139 --> 37:27.499
I am grateful for your kindness, Madam.

37:28.139 --> 37:29.539
You gifted me a smooth jade bracelet.

37:30.340 --> 37:31.579
I have no worthy repayment to offer.

37:32.059 --> 37:33.579
I stitched an aromatic sachet with care.

37:33.700 --> 37:34.820
Please forgive

37:35.260 --> 37:36.340
this humble offering, Madam.

37:37.499 --> 37:39.499
I've heard you excel at gardening.

37:40.220 --> 37:41.579
I invited you here today

37:41.659 --> 37:43.220
to seek your advice.

37:43.700 --> 37:44.740
Where is the best place

37:44.979 --> 37:46.420
to grow narcissus?

37:49.340 --> 37:50.820
Narcissus...

37:53.139 --> 37:55.260
Narcissus dislikes prolonged sunlight.

37:55.499 --> 37:56.579
The water must stay clean.

37:56.900 --> 37:58.139
Otherwise its roots will rot.

37:59.300 --> 38:00.940
Truly, the water must remain pure.

38:02.220 --> 38:03.740
Just as one's heart ought
to stay untainted.

38:05.380 --> 38:07.059
May you be like this narcissus,

38:07.340 --> 38:09.099
blooming gracefully,
never seeking praise.

38:09.420 --> 38:10.340
Miss Fan,

38:10.420 --> 38:11.459
what do you think?

38:16.420 --> 38:17.700
Narcissus is delicate and fussy.

38:18.260 --> 38:20.099
I fear it does not suit the Yu family.

38:20.860 --> 38:21.979
You had better take it back,

38:21.979 --> 38:23.539
and tend to it yourself.

38:27.019 --> 38:29.179
The jade bracelet
I gave you is fine quality.

38:29.740 --> 38:31.579
You need not trouble yourself
with gifts in return.

38:32.099 --> 38:33.539
By the time

38:33.700 --> 38:34.900
you find a rare trinket as this,

38:35.619 --> 38:37.619
my son will likely have passed
the imperial exam.

38:39.820 --> 38:41.499
Madam Yu lacks the insight
to see its worth.

38:41.619 --> 38:44.220
She fails to see all the care
you put into this sachet.

38:51.179 --> 38:52.179
Tell me.

38:54.499 --> 38:56.659
Tingyun's hairpin stirs wicks often,

38:57.740 --> 38:58.940
yet it never tarnishes.

39:00.300 --> 39:02.019
Mine, though, has faded like this.

39:02.220 --> 39:03.619
True gold fears no fire.

39:03.860 --> 39:04.900
The Ninth Young Lady

39:04.900 --> 39:06.099
must wear a golden hairpin.

39:06.619 --> 39:07.099
Indeed.

39:09.780 --> 39:11.860
Silver is inherently lesser than gold.

39:13.820 --> 39:16.260
No wonder Madam Zuo
laments the unfairness of this world.

39:17.139 --> 39:19.099
Tingyun is a golden hairpin by birth,

39:20.740 --> 39:22.099
while I am only silver.

39:24.019 --> 39:26.300
Without elevating my station
through marriage,

39:27.619 --> 39:28.820
I shall never earn

39:31.300 --> 39:32.619
genuine respect from others.

39:36.860 --> 39:38.499
There will be a poetry gathering
in a few days.

39:39.300 --> 39:41.179
Old Madam Fu and I
have come to an agreement.

39:41.619 --> 39:43.340
You shall meet Ninth Young Lady there.

39:43.940 --> 39:45.459
You must present this poem then,

39:45.459 --> 39:46.579
and claim the top prize.

39:46.820 --> 39:48.740
Two champions shall form a match.

39:48.979 --> 39:50.499
It would be a lovely tale to tell.

40:21.260 --> 40:21.860
Mr. Zhao.

40:21.979 --> 40:22.700
It's me.

40:23.940 --> 40:24.820
What are you doing here?

40:26.099 --> 40:27.420
Didn't I order you to be sent off?

40:28.820 --> 40:30.579
How could I leave you all alone?

40:30.579 --> 40:31.820
So I slipped back.

40:32.019 --> 40:33.539
Who's really worried about who?

40:33.780 --> 40:34.380
How old am I?

40:34.380 --> 40:35.019
And how old are you?

40:35.420 --> 40:36.220
Enough of this.

40:38.579 --> 40:39.740
Just finish this one errand.

40:42.380 --> 40:43.539
There will be an event here shortly,

40:44.380 --> 40:45.700
a poetry gathering.

40:57.780 --> 40:58.539
Where's the censer?

40:59.139 --> 40:59.940
Over there.

41:00.300 --> 41:00.940
Bring it over.

41:10.659 --> 41:11.780
Don't let go, My Lady.

41:11.979 --> 41:13.179
When Mr. Yu draws near,

41:13.300 --> 41:14.579
waft the incense scent toward him.

41:18.380 --> 41:21.700
Greetings, Madam Yu and Old Madam Fu.

41:27.780 --> 41:30.059
Once you enter today's poetry gathering,

41:30.420 --> 41:32.220
all blossoms will pale in comparison.

41:32.420 --> 41:33.780
Not to mention Mr. Yu,

41:33.900 --> 41:35.179
even the finest noble households

41:35.179 --> 41:35.860
would be fortunate to have you.

41:37.099 --> 41:38.059
Enough of your flattery.

41:41.459 --> 41:42.659
Insolent! Where are you from?

41:42.659 --> 41:43.619
Have you no sense?

41:44.499 --> 41:45.179
Let it be.

42:06.700 --> 42:07.499
Stay quiet.

42:11.179 --> 42:12.420
I've come to strike a deal

42:12.860 --> 42:14.179
with you, Ninth Young Lady.

42:14.340 --> 42:15.260
My Lady.

42:15.260 --> 42:17.019
Your family owes me
ten thousand taels for the salt trade.

42:19.260 --> 42:20.860
Would you do me a kindness

42:21.459 --> 42:22.539
and gather the sum for me?

42:23.979 --> 42:25.740
Weren't you so powerful before?

42:27.579 --> 42:28.979
Take me if you must.

42:29.740 --> 42:31.380
My lady and I share a deep bond.

42:31.380 --> 42:32.940
She would never abandon me.

42:32.940 --> 42:34.380
She will surely pay the ransom for me.

42:34.499 --> 42:35.740
She is merely a maid.

42:38.220 --> 42:39.300
She's not worth such a sum.

42:39.700 --> 42:40.700
My Lady.

42:41.260 --> 42:42.420
Leave me here.

42:43.059 --> 42:44.220
Send her to gather the money.

42:45.619 --> 42:47.300
Quit playing tricks on me.

42:47.940 --> 42:49.740
I want those silver notes right now.

42:51.139 --> 42:52.019
At once.

42:53.459 --> 42:54.179
Yuwei.

43:01.420 --> 43:02.659
I shall go raise the funds at once.

43:02.740 --> 43:03.459
But there is one request.

43:03.740 --> 43:05.459
I beg you, sir, do not make a commotion.

43:06.059 --> 43:07.220
My lady

43:07.499 --> 43:08.619
is in talks of a marriage match.

43:09.099 --> 43:11.380
If anyone finds her alone in a room
with an unrelated man,

43:11.740 --> 43:13.619
her entire life will be ruined.

43:16.659 --> 43:18.659
It all depends on how quickly
you can get the money.

43:44.288 --> 43:46.640
(Next Episode)

43:48.019 --> 43:48.900
My Lady,

43:49.340 --> 43:50.340
Old Madam Fu

43:50.340 --> 43:51.940
will let us leave safely, right?

43:52.260 --> 43:54.099
If the charge of adultery sticks to me,

43:55.059 --> 43:56.979
the three chastity memorial arches
standing before the Fu Residence

43:56.979 --> 43:57.820
will all crumble.

43:58.499 --> 43:59.979
This concerns
the Fu family's reputation.

44:00.539 --> 44:01.499
It won't be that simple.

44:02.499 --> 44:04.099
All ancestors awarded chastity arches,

44:04.659 --> 44:06.940
along with widows maintaining
their chastity now,

44:07.539 --> 44:09.099
have come to demand an explanation.

44:10.579 --> 44:11.740
As for Ninth Young Lady's disgrace,

44:12.019 --> 44:14.179
a decision must be made at once.

44:14.579 --> 44:15.619
(Eight-Character Slip)
What

44:16.059 --> 44:17.539
becomes of this girl

44:17.940 --> 44:19.979
is entirely up to you, Madam.

44:32.121 --> 44:36.441
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:40.041 --> 44:44.401
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:46.521 --> 44:51.161
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:51.401 --> 44:54.201
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

44:55.361 --> 45:00.001
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:03.201 --> 45:10.041
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:10.921 --> 45:17.441
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:18.401 --> 45:21.841
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:22.361 --> 45:26.561
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:26.841 --> 45:32.521
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:44.641 --> 45:48.521
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:52.441 --> 45:56.441
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

45:58.161 --> 46:02.841
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:03.161 --> 46:05.841
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:06.921 --> 46:11.761
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:15.281 --> 46:22.201
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:23.081 --> 46:29.561
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:30.441 --> 46:33.961
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:34.401 --> 46:38.761
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:38.961 --> 46:44.681
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
